# The Paladin's last class node: a thrown hammer that hunts one enemy after
# another, leaving a shockwave on each.
#
# GMS uses charges instead of a cooldown: one hammer every twelve seconds, up to
# three held, thrown one at a time or all at once. Written as all three thrown
# together: three hammers every thirty-six seconds. The sustained rate is a
# hammer every twelve either way, and the burst is the point: a fight has no
# windows but a job does, and a Paladin uses this with Divine Echo.
#
# The four enemies each hammer tracks are hit at once instead of one after
# another, which is what a swing here can express, so three hammers are three
# strikes on the same four, not twelve separate targets. Still twelve
# shockwaves: one for every enemy every hammer tracks.
#
# The shockwave hits six of its own, so it is a side strike, not an extra hit,
# since an extra hit always shares the swing's reach. It comes with the cast
# with no timer of its own: this is used once per cooldown, so every use should
# trigger one. The extra critical rate belongs to the hammer only, as GMS states
# it.
#
# 570ms is the data's own q, the only leftover value that looks like a cast
# time. GMS publishes no frame data for this one.
#
# Dropped: throwing several hammers with the direction keys, Omnia Mode, and the
# right-click toggle, all of them key presses.
name: "Mighty Mjolnir"
description:
  "Summon the hammer of an ancient god, then hurl it straight toward your "
  "enemies. Each successful hit creates a powerful shockwave. The hammers "
  "track down the enemy with the highest HP, aside from the one it had just "
  "attacked. All of the hammers' attacks are unaffected by attack reflection."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ATTACK
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_PALADIN_V skill_order: 4 }
v_node: V_NODE_KIND_JOB
max_level: 30
required_equip_type: EQUIP_TYPE_ONE_HANDED_SWORD
required_equip_type: EQUIP_TYPE_TWO_HANDED_SWORD
required_equip_type: EQUIP_TYPE_ONE_HANDED_BLUNT
required_equip_type: EQUIP_TYPE_TWO_HANDED_BLUNT
base_delay_ms: 570
cooldown_seconds: 36.0
max_enemies: 4
lines: 6
casts: 3
base {
  skill_pct: 2.45
  crit_rate: 0.50
}
per_level { skill_pct: 0.10 }
side_strike {
  label: "Shockwave"
  max_enemies: 6
  lines: 9
  casts: 12
  base { skill_pct: 2.86 }
  per_level { skill_pct: 0.11 }
}
